1
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:29,160
Your Highness,

2
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,760
is the poison acting up again?

3
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,560
Give me the medicine.

4
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,200
But

5
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,430
Physician Xie said...
Give it to me.

6
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,600
Don't worry.

7
00:01:04,784 --> 00:01:06,140
It will hold me over for a while.

8
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,560
I, as a blade,

9
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:13,430
swear to protect you to the death.

10
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:26,480
Remember this.

11
00:01:27,824 --> 00:01:29,840
When facing battle,
do not harbor a death wish.

12
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,400
You must hold onto the will to live.

13
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,350
You are not a blade.

14
00:01:36,310 --> 00:01:37,230
You are my man.

15
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:05,660
=Blossoms of Power=

16
00:03:05,670 --> 00:03:08,570
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

17
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:11,540
=Episode 28=

18
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:32,940
This way.

19
00:03:34,990 --> 00:03:35,630
Careful.

20
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:45,400
Report!

21
00:03:48,150 --> 00:03:48,840
Report!

22
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,150
Report!

23
00:03:53,590 --> 00:03:54,910
The Le tribe has reached Tingzhou.

24
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:57,960
Young Master,

25
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,990
there is no time to lose.

26
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,740
We must send reinforcements
to Tingzhou now.

27
00:04:00,752 --> 00:04:02,864
We cannot let the Le tribe
advance any further.

28
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,240
I, Guo Ying,

29
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,560
beseech you for the order

30
00:04:05,616 --> 00:04:07,264
to reinforce Tingzhou immediately.

31
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:08,190
No,

32
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,470
Uncle Guo.

33
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:10,840
I will go.

34
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:11,910
Young Master,

35
00:04:11,968 --> 00:04:13,072
you are severely injured.

36
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,830
It is not suitable for you
to lead troops right now.

37
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,120
The Duke has not yet awakened.

38
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:18,190
Northwest Army still needs you
to take command.

39
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:19,390
You cannot go.

40
00:04:19,390 --> 00:04:20,630
Please let me go instead.

41
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,680
I request the order

42
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,360
to go to Tingzhou in your stead.

43
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,630
The Crown Prince has arrived!

44
00:04:35,952 --> 00:04:38,496
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

45
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:40,040
Please rise, Generals.

46
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,870
There is no Crown Prince here.

47
00:04:42,224 --> 00:04:43,872
Only the son-in-law of the Shen family.

48
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,630
You are severely injured.

49
00:04:49,712 --> 00:04:51,760
It is indeed unsuitable
for you to go to battle.

50
00:04:52,032 --> 00:04:53,600
As the son-in-law of the Shen family,

51
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,552
I am willing to go to war in your stead.

52
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,560
No.

53
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,830
Weapons have no eyes.

54
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,800
If anything were to happen to you,

55
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,296
how could I explain it to His Majesty?

56
00:05:01,300 --> 00:05:03,710
Once the news of the Duke of Wei's
critical condition spreads,

57
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,584
the foreign tribes will surely
make their move.

58
00:05:05,728 --> 00:05:07,696
The Le tribe is only the enemy
in front of us.

59
00:05:07,712 --> 00:05:09,950
If the foreign tribes learn
that northwest is leaderless,

60
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:10,770
and take advantage of it,

61
00:05:10,784 --> 00:05:13,120
it will only put us
at a greater disadvantage in this war.

62
00:05:13,430 --> 00:05:14,680
Your primary duty

63
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:16,390
is to be the backbone of northwest.

64
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,830
But Your Highness...

65
00:05:18,830 --> 00:05:19,920
The matters you worry about,

66
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:21,190
you can rest assured.

67
00:05:21,616 --> 00:05:24,160
The people of northwest
are also subjects of Daxing.

68
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,504
If I stay out of this,

69
00:05:25,510 --> 00:05:27,720
how can I be fit to sit on the throne
of the Crown Prince?

70
00:05:29,190 --> 00:05:30,000
Please, Young Master,

71
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:31,360
grant me the military seal.

72
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,480
None of you has seen His Highness?

73
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:44,480
We haven't seen His Highness
since early morning.

74
00:05:49,568 --> 00:05:51,040
Where did the Crown Prince go?

75
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,720
His Highness left at dawn,

76
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,064
leading troops to Tingzhou City.

77
00:05:54,432 --> 00:05:55,120
Prepare my horse.

78
00:05:55,152 --> 00:05:56,920
Dispatch all the personal guards
in the manor.

79
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,190
Follow me to Tingzhou City.

80
00:05:58,190 --> 00:06:00,360
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

81
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:35,700
Charge!

82
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:43,160
- Charge!
- Charge!

83
00:06:48,750 --> 00:06:50,950
Charge!

84
00:07:06,510 --> 00:07:07,510
Changtai?

85
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,390
You are the one behind Geng Liangcheng.

86
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,310
Huayong,

87
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:15,040
you've been acting sickly,
deceiving everyone.

88
00:07:15,616 --> 00:07:17,120
Did you think you were the only one

89
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,000
who could turn their face

90
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,800
into a mask?

91
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,720
You actually committed treason.

92
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,260
Have you forgotten

93
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:26,680
the humiliation when the Le tribe
trampled the Central Plains?

94
00:07:26,690 --> 00:07:29,310
Xiao Changtai, you are unworthy of being
a son of the Xiao family!

95
00:07:29,310 --> 00:07:30,000
Shut up!

96
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:33,240
When I win,

97
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,480
history

98
00:07:34,950 --> 00:07:36,600
will be written by me.

99
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,630
Die!

100
00:07:57,430 --> 00:07:58,120
Report!

101
00:07:58,176 --> 00:08:01,248
The Yaozhou garrison broke through the
mountain pass defense and is attacking!

102
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,800
Yaozhou garrison?

103
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,600
Who is leading them?

104
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,430
It's Prince Xin, Xiao Changqing.

105
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:15,190
Soldiers, hear my command!

106
00:08:15,270 --> 00:08:16,160
- Yes!
- Yes!

107
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:19,000
Attack!

108
00:08:19,390 --> 00:08:20,390
Charge!

109
00:08:20,390 --> 00:08:23,600
- Kill!
- Kill!

110
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,670
- Kill!
- Kill!

111
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:14,630
Your Highness,
the battle is lost.

112
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,600
We must retreat!

113
00:10:20,630 --> 00:10:21,240
Go!

114
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:22,960
Retreat!

115
00:10:42,470 --> 00:10:44,710
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

116
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:48,290
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

117
00:10:49,610 --> 00:10:54,890
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

118
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:56,550
Why are you here?

119
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:59,760
♪I've hidden so many words♪

120
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,720
If you dare to act on your own again,

121
00:11:01,776 --> 00:11:03,088
I won't let you off lightly.

122
00:11:04,270 --> 00:11:05,030
Yes, my princess.

123
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:11,020
♪So never uncover♪

124
00:11:11,210 --> 00:11:13,910
♪Wind that misses the grasp♪

125
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:17,290
♪Light that ignites at a single touch♪

126
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:23,400
♪A person can find strength
time and again♪

127
00:11:25,590 --> 00:11:28,330
♪Our past♪

128
00:11:29,050 --> 00:11:31,320
♪Has been full of ups and downs
along the way♪

129
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,368
It's so good to have you.

130
00:11:32,740 --> 00:11:34,350
♪Admitting my confusion♪

131
00:11:34,350 --> 00:11:36,290
♪Just like your regret♪

132
00:11:36,290 --> 00:11:39,930
♪How hard can it be?♪

133
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:46,170
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

134
00:11:47,090 --> 00:11:49,720
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

135
00:11:50,590 --> 00:11:55,740
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

136
00:11:55,760 --> 00:12:02,750
- We won!
- We won!

137
00:12:04,430 --> 00:12:08,400
♪So please try your best
to be open first♪

138
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:09,320
Let's go home!

139
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:10,790
Let's go home!

140
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:14,080
- We're going home!
- Let's go home!

141
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,790
Nice!

142
00:12:16,140 --> 00:12:19,460
(Shen)

143
00:12:19,460 --> 00:12:22,780
(Tingzhou)

144
00:12:22,780 --> 00:12:28,720
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

145
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:35,540
♪The flustered mortal world♪

146
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:37,300
- We won!
- We won!

147
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:43,340
♪Your eyes remain clear and bright♪

148
00:13:00,510 --> 00:13:01,630
For the next few days,

149
00:13:01,870 --> 00:13:03,720
you must be very careful, Your Highness.

150
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,750
Don't let the wound get wet.

151
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:09,000
Get out, all of you.

152
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:34,630
Report!

153
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:36,840
Your Highness,

154
00:13:36,912 --> 00:13:38,464
the Princess Consort wishes to see you.

155
00:13:40,660 --> 00:13:43,020
(Willows Reflected
in the Meandering Stream)

156
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,510
You're back.

157
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:42,150
Come sit.

158
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:01,360
I cooked myself

159
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,910
and made some of your favorite dishes.

160
00:15:05,390 --> 00:15:06,080
Yanyan,

161
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,720
you look beautiful today.

162
00:15:09,670 --> 00:15:11,360
Just like the day of our grand wedding,

163
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,440
when you first married me.

164
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:22,120
Come,

165
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,080
have a taste.

166
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,870
You don't think

167
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,510
that seeing you defeated,

168
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,600
I'd kill you to claim credit, do you?

169
00:15:50,630 --> 00:15:52,200
How could I ever doubt you?

170
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:55,080
I just don't trust anyone else.

171
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,000
Given our current situation,

172
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,670
if someone wanted us dead,

173
00:16:12,550 --> 00:16:14,150
why would they even bother with poison?

174
00:16:22,550 --> 00:16:23,200
Yanyan,

175
00:16:25,072 --> 00:16:27,072
you should go back
to the imperial capital.

176
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,870
Right now,

177
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,390
I have nowhere left to run.

178
00:16:32,030 --> 00:16:33,240
But you're different.

179
00:16:34,336 --> 00:16:37,000
Everyone knows you were confined
to the manor by His Majesty.

180
00:16:38,270 --> 00:16:39,840
No one knows you came to northwest.

181
00:16:40,910 --> 00:16:42,320
Everything I've done

182
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:44,120
has nothing to do with you.

183
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,480
I can't go back.

184
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,670
Making the wrong choice

185
00:17:00,670 --> 00:17:01,790
leads to a path of no return.

186
00:17:05,350 --> 00:17:06,200
Yanyan.

187
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,160
I never wanted you to fight

188
00:17:15,344 --> 00:17:17,360
for that dragon throne
in Mingzheng Hall.

189
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:19,920
In your eyes,

190
00:17:20,350 --> 00:17:22,070
it's the path
to supreme imperial power.

191
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,070
But in mine,

192
00:17:28,590 --> 00:17:30,480
it's a deep grave
leading to the underworld.

193
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:00,920
Yanyan,

194
00:18:02,270 --> 00:18:03,310
what are you doing?

195
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,270
I'm truly tired.

196
00:18:12,270 --> 00:18:13,400
All these years,

197
00:18:14,350 --> 00:18:15,960
in front of everyone,

198
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,960
you acted like
you were madly in love with me.

199
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:23,480
But I was always just
a knife in your hand,

200
00:18:24,590 --> 00:18:26,270
a mask you wore in public.

201
00:18:29,270 --> 00:18:30,640
I'm truly tired of it.

202
00:18:32,550 --> 00:18:33,270
Yanyan,
don't.

203
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:34,720
Yanyan!

204
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:36,110
Don't!

205
00:18:36,110 --> 00:18:38,820
♪Time is like a river flowing backward♪

206
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:41,450
♪The story is sketched anew♪

207
00:18:41,510 --> 00:18:43,030
No!

208
00:18:46,460 --> 00:18:49,220
♪The tide engulfs the lines on my palm♪

209
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:51,940
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

210
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:56,420
♪Sifting for joy in a sea of sorrow♪

211
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:59,260
♪I step onto this winding path♪

212
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:00,030
Yanyan.

213
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:02,060
♪What was swept away?♪

214
00:19:02,260 --> 00:19:06,420
♪Joy and sorrow show no emotion♪

215
00:19:07,510 --> 00:19:08,960
I only hope in the next life,

216
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,960
we'll never meet again.

217
00:19:12,980 --> 00:19:17,540
♪Only to find it's just a bubble♪

218
00:19:18,790 --> 00:19:21,060
♪Scene after scene of yesterday♪

219
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:23,930
♪Lies between the sky and the water♪

220
00:19:23,930 --> 00:19:26,300
♪The stars are sinking♪

221
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:29,300
♪Like a sunken vow♪

222
00:19:29,790 --> 00:19:32,470
♪You drifted away alone♪

223
00:19:33,100 --> 00:19:37,540
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

224
00:19:38,410 --> 00:19:41,020
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

225
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:45,290
♪I can only stay there forever♪

226
00:19:45,290 --> 00:19:50,520
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

227
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,930
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

228
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:57,330
♪Waiting for regret to swallow me up♪

229
00:20:11,380 --> 00:20:18,380
(Half a Month Later)

230
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:26,880
Charge!

231
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:29,480
Charge!

232
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:35,000
General Shitou,

233
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,440
flank the enemy from behind!

234
00:20:42,110 --> 00:20:43,270
General Xiaoniu,

235
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:45,110
the enemy has been repelled.

236
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:47,110
We must press our advantage!

237
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:55,240
My shoulder's been hit!

238
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:56,070
I'm still alive.

239
00:20:56,070 --> 00:20:57,310
I can still fight!

240
00:20:58,830 --> 00:20:59,480
Good!

241
00:21:00,030 --> 00:21:01,510
Spoken like a true soldier.

242
00:21:04,270 --> 00:21:04,960
Charge!

243
00:21:06,830 --> 00:21:07,680
Father.

244
00:21:08,544 --> 00:21:10,220
You haven't recovered
from your injuries.

245
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:11,552
Why are you out here again?

246
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:14,640
You know your father.

247
00:21:15,030 --> 00:21:17,310
I just can't sit still.

248
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,680
If you focus on recovering,

249
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:24,270
I'll cook something special
to reward you tonight.

250
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:25,480
I'll listen to you.

251
00:21:26,590 --> 00:21:28,070
I'll do whatever you say.

252
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:33,550
As they say, military orders
on the battlefield are absolute.

253
00:21:33,790 --> 00:21:34,640
But at home...

254
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:37,472
What do you say, my good son-in-law?

255
00:21:39,856 --> 00:21:41,632
Youyou is in charge of everything.

256
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:44,480
Well said.

257
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:51,920
Youyou,

258
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:53,920
your cooking has improved again.

259
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,030
It's very flavorful.

260
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,110
Then eat some more.

261
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,070
Okay.

262
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:09,310
Father-in-law,

263
00:22:09,328 --> 00:22:11,344
this is freshly grilled.
Please, have a taste.

264
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:12,880
Grilled by you?

265
00:22:13,030 --> 00:22:13,440
Yes.

266
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,550
I absolutely cannot accept this.

267
00:22:15,640 --> 00:22:17,650
There is a distinction
between ruler and subject.

268
00:22:17,664 --> 00:22:19,110
I am not worthy.

269
00:22:21,110 --> 00:22:21,790
Father-in-law,

270
00:22:21,792 --> 00:22:23,780
the day I first entered
northwest's military camp,

271
00:22:23,790 --> 00:22:25,720
I told the generals and Yun'an

272
00:22:25,744 --> 00:22:27,170
that there is no Crown Prince here,

273
00:22:27,296 --> 00:22:28,736
only the Shen family's son-in-law.

274
00:22:28,784 --> 00:22:30,496
That is even more true today.

275
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:37,000
All right.

276
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,110
Then

277
00:22:38,310 --> 00:22:39,510
thank you, my good son-in-law.

278
00:22:48,790 --> 00:22:49,270
Come.

279
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,830
In the battle of Tingzhou,

280
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:00,790
you protected our territory

281
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:02,680
and executed the traitor.

282
00:23:03,270 --> 00:23:04,480
Tonight, you and I

283
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:06,240
must have a few more drinks.

284
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,510
Since you're in high spirits,

285
00:23:09,792 --> 00:23:11,310
I will certainly keep you company.

286
00:23:11,830 --> 00:23:13,160
But you're still injured,

287
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,880
so please remember
to drink in moderation.

288
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:16,480
All right.

289
00:23:17,070 --> 00:23:18,200
I'll listen to both of you.

290
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:29,920
What is this?

291
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:31,110
It smells so good.

292
00:23:31,510 --> 00:23:33,400
I don't think
I've ever smelled it before.

293
00:23:34,368 --> 00:23:37,290
This incense is made by pouring strong
liquor over it and burning it dry.

294
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:39,880
Once lit, the aroma
of the liquor is intoxicating.

295
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,120
It's just like drinking alcohol,

296
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,550
but it doesn't harm the body.

297
00:23:42,592 --> 00:23:44,480
And there's no hangover
when you wake up.

298
00:23:46,750 --> 00:23:47,400
Right.

299
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:50,030
I'm already feeling a bit dizzy.

300
00:23:50,110 --> 00:23:50,920
It feels like

301
00:23:51,830 --> 00:23:53,880
I've drunk several jugs of liquor.

302
00:23:55,790 --> 00:23:56,240
Here.

303
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:57,750
Okay.

304
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:38,480
Since you're so worried about Father,

305
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:40,960
