understand everything,

313
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:58,680
and see through everything.

314
00:25:00,590 --> 00:25:01,720
In the past,

315
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:04,110
I never paid much attention
to matters of the heart.

316
00:25:04,750 --> 00:25:05,590
But from now on,

317
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:07,590
I will devote my heart to you.

318
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:21,310
Let's take Father back first.

319
00:25:22,510 --> 00:25:23,350
And then,

320
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,480
