349
00:27:59,536 --> 00:28:01,728
I've painstakingly cultivated them
for years.

350
00:28:02,030 --> 00:28:03,920
Finally, I have some
useful subordinates.

351
00:28:04,310 --> 00:28:05,590
They are all on this list.

352
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,590
To you, these

353
00:28:08,200 --> 00:28:09,750
are crucial secrets.

354
00:28:10,110 --> 00:28:11,480
It's everything you have.

355
00:28:12,510 --> 00:28:13,750
And you're giving it all to me?

356
00:28:13,920 --> 00:28:15,680
We are husband and wife, of one mind.

357
00:28:16,550 --> 00:28:17,590
What is mine

358
00:28:18,070 --> 00:28:19,310
naturally belongs to you too.

359
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:24,480
Actually, I've been

360
00:28:25,152 --> 00:28:27,160
looking for a chance
to give this list to you.

361
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:29,480
Now that the situation is settled,

362
00:28:30,310 --> 00:28:31,160
in the court,

363
00:28:31,232 --> 00:28:34,080
you have your grandfather
and the Cui family for civil affairs,

364
00:28:34,384 --> 00:28:37,200
and the Duke of Wei and the
Marquis of Shunan for military affairs.

365
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:39,750
You also manage the inner palace.

366
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:41,550
The people on this list

367
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:43,790
are all reliable.

368
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:46,400
They can be of help to you
in the future.

369
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:51,200
You've planned so thoroughly for me,

370
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:55,750
arranging every step for me.

371
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:57,720
It's you who took every step

372
00:28:58,110 --> 00:28:59,200
steadily.

373
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:01,310
I merely assisted from the sidelines.

374
00:29:01,952 --> 00:29:04,310
I was the one who pulled you
into this worldly chaos.

375
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,350
Now,

376
00:29:06,070 --> 00:29:07,680
I just want to make it up to you more.

377
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,480
Today, since we are

378
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:24,160
being honest with each other,

379
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:26,000
then...

380
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,830
I will tell you something, too.

381
00:29:30,350 --> 00:29:31,510
Do you remember

382
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:33,480
when Prince Xin

383
00:29:34,510 --> 00:29:36,160
called me Gu Qingzhi?

384
00:29:37,530 --> 00:29:40,570
♪Pushing the sea of stars
to flow across♪

385
00:29:40,790 --> 00:29:41,750
So,

386
00:29:42,110 --> 00:29:44,590
