387
00:29:44,590 --> 00:29:46,960
♪In an endless cycle♪

388
00:29:49,440 --> 00:29:50,200
Xihe...

389
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:52,740
♪Soft voices in the moonlight♪

390
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:54,070
I am deeply in love with you.

391
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:58,880
I want to be bound to you in marriage

392
00:30:00,096 --> 00:30:02,112
and spend the rest of my life with you.

393
00:30:03,880 --> 00:30:04,830
The one I love

394
00:30:05,472 --> 00:30:07,680
is Shen Xihe, the person
standing right in front of me.

395
00:30:07,888 --> 00:30:09,400
Not Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

396
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:11,760
Not the beloved daughter
of the Duke of Wei.

397
00:30:12,270 --> 00:30:13,750
Nor anyone else.

398
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:15,480
Just you.

399
00:30:15,870 --> 00:30:19,710
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

400
00:30:20,650 --> 00:30:23,490
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

401
00:30:23,890 --> 00:30:27,500
♪Are gently gathered
into your elegant sleeves♪

402
00:30:28,610 --> 00:30:31,370
♪Gradually, on the misty path♪

403
00:30:31,870 --> 00:30:35,670
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

404
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:50,590
I once promised you

405
00:30:50,944 --> 00:30:52,160
that if there ever came a day

406
00:30:52,608 --> 00:30:53,830
when I fell in love with you,

407
00:30:54,790 --> 00:30:56,310
I would tell you immediately.

408
00:30:57,730 --> 00:31:00,640
♪People come and go♪

409
00:31:01,590 --> 00:31:02,640
Xiao Huayong,

410
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,680
I love you.

411
00:31:09,140 --> 00:31:12,490
♪When I gaze upon you♪

412
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:16,400
♪Our destiny is beyond anyone's control♪

413
00:31:16,980 --> 00:31:18,680
♪Everything♪

414
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:24,090
♪Is past the point of no return♪

415
00:31:24,660 --> 00:31:27,550
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

416
00:31:27,810 --> 00:31:31,710
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

417
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:35,490
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

418
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:40,270
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

419
00:31:40,690 --> 00:31:43,520
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

420
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:47,780
♪Are gently gathered
into your elegant sleeves♪

421
00:31:48,700 --> 00:31:51,540
♪Gradually, on the misty path♪

422
00:31:51,870 --> 00:31:56,340
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

423
00:31:57,750 --> 00:32:01,420
♪I once said all my goodbyes
in a past life♪

424
00:32:01,420 --> 00:32:03,870
♪Weeping silently♪

425
00:32:05,900 --> 00:32:14,300
♪I will hold you in this lifetime
until the very end♪

426
00:32:37,270 --> 00:32:38,000
Father,

427
00:32:38,400 --> 00:32:39,550
after I go back,

428
00:32:39,790 --> 00:32:42,110
please don't delay
taking your daily medicine.

429
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:45,680
Youyou,

430
00:32:46,070 --> 00:32:47,590
with such a long distance between us,

431
00:32:48,030 --> 00:32:50,590
I don't know when I'll be able
to see you again.

432
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:55,400
Father, Yun'an, please don't worry.

433
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:57,160
After I return to the capital,

434
00:32:57,616 --> 00:32:59,520
I will personally ask His Majesty
for a favor.

435
00:32:59,790 --> 00:33:00,880
My father often says,

436
00:33:01,720 --> 00:33:03,750
the royal family also
values family bonds.

437
00:33:03,792 --> 00:33:06,576
He will surely grant permission
for a visit at the end of the year.

438
00:33:08,350 --> 00:33:09,680
Having such a good son-in-law,

439
00:33:09,984 --> 00:33:11,520
what do I have to worry about?

440
00:33:12,976 --> 00:33:14,350
Take good care of yourselves

441
00:33:14,448 --> 00:33:15,720
and look after each other.

442
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:30,790
- Thank you, Your Highness!
- Thank you, Your Highness!

443
00:33:30,848 --> 00:33:33,136
- Thank you, Your Highness!
- Thank you, Your Highness!

444
00:33:40,240 --> 00:33:41,160
Please take it.

445
00:33:41,880 --> 00:33:42,880
Please take it.

446
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:43,880
Please take it.

447
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:44,750
Thank you.

448
00:33:46,200 --> 00:33:47,510
Thank you, Your Highness!

449
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:50,200
Thank you, Your Highness!

450
00:33:50,224 --> 00:33:53,510
- Thank you, Your Highness!
- Thank you, Your Highness!

451
00:33:53,640 --> 00:33:55,110
Thank you, Your Highness!

452
00:34:14,550 --> 00:34:15,280
Stop the carriage.

453
00:34:26,510 --> 00:34:30,110
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

454
00:34:30,192 --> 00:34:32,016
Please, everyone,
no need for formalities.

455
00:34:34,280 --> 00:34:35,550
Bringing blessings to the people

456
00:34:36,150 --> 00:34:38,070
is truly the duty of my wife and me.

457
00:34:39,070 --> 00:34:39,670
Great.

458
00:34:40,512 --> 00:34:41,400
That's wonderful.
Excellent.

459
00:34:45,030 --> 00:34:47,760
I only hope that northwest
will have favorable weather,

460
00:34:48,150 --> 00:34:49,320
and remain peaceful and safe.

461
00:34:49,424 --> 00:34:51,660
May our nation prosper
and our people live in peace.

462
00:34:51,670 --> 00:34:53,880
- Well said!
- Well said!

463
00:34:57,190 --> 00:34:58,510
Peace and prosperity!

464
00:34:59,510 --> 00:35:01,510
- Well said!
- Well said!

465
00:35:18,560 --> 00:35:20,992
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

466
00:35:32,590 --> 00:35:33,880
Greetings, Your Highness.

467
00:35:34,230 --> 00:35:35,320
Greetings, Crown Princess.

468
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:44,550
Changqing.

469
00:35:45,728 --> 00:35:46,920
For the battle of Tingzhou,

470
00:35:46,992 --> 00:35:48,720
I haven't had the chance to thank you.

471
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:49,780
No need for formalities.

472
00:35:50,630 --> 00:35:52,320
I receive a salary and enjoy a fief.

473
00:35:52,784 --> 00:35:54,640
It's my duty
to share the court's burdens.

474
00:35:56,510 --> 00:35:57,150
Then,

475
00:35:58,096 --> 00:35:59,808
