495
00:37:52,110 --> 00:37:52,800
Is it good?

496
00:37:54,920 --> 00:37:55,630
Not bad.

497
00:38:02,400 --> 00:38:03,760
By taking action this time,

498
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:05,550
your martial arts skills

499
00:38:06,670 --> 00:38:07,760
are pretty much exposed.

500
00:38:12,150 --> 00:38:13,110
So what?

501
00:38:16,416 --> 00:38:18,630
Aren't you afraid word of this
will reach the court?

502
00:38:20,030 --> 00:38:21,480
And your years of feigning illness

503
00:38:22,030 --> 00:38:23,110
will all be for nothing?

504
00:38:25,904 --> 00:38:28,176
If I can't protect the army
and people of northwest,

505
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:30,670
or my closest loved ones,

506
00:38:30,976 --> 00:38:33,072
no matter how well I hide my true self,

507
00:38:33,190 --> 00:38:34,070
what's the point?

508
00:38:54,320 --> 00:38:55,510
Me feeding you wontons

509
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:57,360
