521
00:39:41,710 --> 00:39:44,650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

522
00:39:45,270 --> 00:39:48,070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

523
00:39:48,940 --> 00:39:55,910
♪So never uncover♪

524
00:39:56,100 --> 00:39:58,460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

525
00:39:59,590 --> 00:40:02,320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

526
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:08,620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

527
00:40:10,380 --> 00:40:13,200
♪Every answer I gave♪

528
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:16,850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

529
00:40:17,640 --> 00:40:21,010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

530
00:40:21,270 --> 00:40:24,580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

531
00:40:27,550 --> 00:40:30,990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

532
00:40:31,980 --> 00:40:34,310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

533
00:40:35,580 --> 00:40:41,340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

534
00:40:42,750 --> 00:40:45,880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

535
00:40:46,330 --> 00:40:49,340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

536
00:40:49,450 --> 00:40:56,090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

537
00:40:56,090 --> 00:40:59,760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

538
00:41:00,630 --> 00:41:03,390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

539
00:41:03,830 --> 00:41:06,960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

540
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:13,350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

541
00:41:14,750 --> 00:41:18,300
♪You'll never♪

542
00:41:18,580 --> 00:41:28,050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

543
00:41:54,220 --> 00:41:57,700
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
